{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕停下又陷回僵住的犹豫，便抓住那个曾让自己动起来的决定，逼自己继续往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼自己继续往前\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得那种亲近、不必防备的生活曾让自己真切地快乐，眼下再难受也舍不得说它不值得。\",\n      \"key\": \"说它不值得\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想靠坚持稳住自己，可那种曾让他安心的生活眼下仍够不着，他也怕它不能照旧回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"不能照旧回来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一遍遍问当初有没有别的办法，想继续往前又不丢掉那种生活，却怎么也想不出答案。\",\n      \"key\": \"想不出答案\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R14\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留决定曾让他脱离犹豫的实际作用，并接回S02中害怕退回原地、急着撑住自己的心理，解释他为何仍逼自己向前，也补足身体无法停下的压力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留先前的温暖和快乐确实发生过，不因眼下难受就否定它。改成他舍不得说那段生活不值得，并取消与R14的因果连接，因为两者是同时成立的两面。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把没有被行动安顿的牵挂写成他仍想靠近那种生活，却怕它无法照旧回来；再写他因此反复寻找别的办法。这样补足记忆太好却难以重现的刺痛，以及思绪盘旋、行动无法带来安心的原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"由S04-1保留行动确实让他动起来的价值，由S04-4写出他仍找不到兼顾行动与旧愿的办法。行动的限度通过他实际想解决却无法解决的难题呈现，不再替他宣布抽象结论。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "46faa682-0120-4842-8847-4cf30a4194f0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053313726157Z", "elapsed_seconds": 241.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:37:15.645736+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73b92fb6760dd3c3674cb3e59ca1e2842236fc6ad7a681bce2c4295ad45bbe3c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_ev